eth 1.0.0-7: the amigaux z3660eth driver, with the 040/060 board mapping

src/z3660eth.c and .h are amigaux z3660eth 1.0.0-7 (ZS-05 armed accesses,
resync of a wedged RX ring) with our dev_kvmap mapping (patch 0001) kept; its
cache hunk placed by hand.  Booted on the A3000 with a Z3660 (68060)
2026-11-04 in unix.z3-vt2, now the default kernel.

